# yard: outside the factory, sixteen seconds looping: the floor's low G
# drone heard muffled through the wall, wind as four seashore gusts an
# octave up at shifting strength, the fence whistling twice as a quiet
# blown bottle, and one distant vehicle passing from 7.6 to 14.2 seconds
# as overlapping low seashore washes rising and falling in strength and
# dropping a semitone past the midpoint, a low helicopter patch for its
# engine. Drone and wind join on alternating channels at every segment,
# the loop's seam included, so the seam is like the joins inside.
